35,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The budget is down a quarter. Fitting out is now charged to development.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shion,,The call-back trial reduced readmissions by a fifth. It worked.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Midori,,Therapy staff are leaving. Midwifery has slack. Ward nursing is critical.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Kenji,,Rooms book out by mid-morning. The car park fills before eleven.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The joint clinic closed because neither department held the budget.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
