45,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,The booking system only records named slots. Unlogged work disappears.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shion,,"We need a program that fits the existing gaps, not a new burden.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Midori,,Midwifery has capacity. Therapy does not.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Kenji,,We cannot add more outpatient traffic. The infrastructure is full.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shizue,,We must avoid programs that rely on outside bodies we don't control.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
